# DRUM & DANCE WORKSHOPS

![](/media/2017/11/Circle-final.png)

## WE USE REAL AFRICAN DRUMS IN ALL OF OUR WORKSHOPS!

## DRUM & DANCE WORKSHOPS

[GET A QUICK & EASY QUOTE](/quick-quote/)

Bring laughter, joy, movement & rhythm and create an ensemble of drummers and dancers at your next special event. African drumming workshops and African dancing workshops with Rhythm Culture are fun, exciting, and will bring pure fun and enjoyment to your group! Experience real African drums, percussion & professional drum and dance facilitators who will share their knowledge and skill that has come straight from the heart of Africa.

There are no travel fees, drum hire, or maximum group numbers and professional facilitators will ensure your group have an unforgettable experience. Rhythm Culture provides interactive drumming and dancing workshops for school incursions, child care and vacation care centres, kindergartens, corporate teams and companies. Choose from our diverse range of drum and dance workshops to cater for your next event.

